classDiagram
 class User {
  +String id
  +Role role
  +Boolean active
 }
 class Incident {
  +String reference
  +Status status
  +Int version
 }
 class AuditEvent {
  +String canonicalPayload
  +String digest
  +String previousDigest
 }
 class BlockchainAnchor {
  +AnchorStatus status
  +String transactionHash
  +Int attempts
 }
 class VerificationService {
  +verifyEvent()
  +verifyBatch()
 }
 class Chain {
  +ready()
  +get()
  +inventory()
 }
 class Finding {
  +String result
  +String severity
  +String status
  +Json notes
 }
 User "1" --> "many" Incident : reports
 Incident --> AuditEvent : generates
 AuditEvent --> BlockchainAnchor : queued commitment
 VerificationService --> AuditEvent : reconstructs
 VerificationService --> Chain : reads independent evidence
 VerificationService --> Finding : creates
